# South Africa Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to South Africa's governance ecosystem.

The objective is to illustrate how governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), public finance, institutional memory, intergovernmental coordination, and AI governance combine to strengthen national capability and long-term competitiveness.

This document is an illustrative institutional reference architecture.

---

# National Context

Country: Republic of South Africa

Population: ~64 million

Government System: Constitutional Parliamentary Republic

Administrative Structure

- National Government
- 9 Provinces
- Metropolitan Municipalities
- District Municipalities
- Local Municipalities

